              "en-us": {
                "about": {
                  "attribution": null,
                  "body": "The Commerce Inn is an Early American West Village tavern and cookery from esteemed West Village chefs Jody Williams and Rita Sodi. The Commerce Inn celebrates Shaker sensibilities of utility, craftsmanship, community and material honesty. Our kitchen focuses on fresh and straight-forward fare inspired by heirloom recipes and local traditions, always prepared simply and served casually with a spirit of care and warmth.",
