                  "enhanced_body": null,
                  "title": null
                },
                "why_we_like_it": {
                  "attribution": null,
                  "body": "The dream team behind West Village favorites Via Carota, Buvette, and I Sodi \u2014 Jody Williams and Rita Sodi \u2014 are behind this new all-American tavern. The decor is Shaker-inspired, with austere but meticulously crafted furnishings, and the cuisine draws on 19th-century Yankee cookbooks.",
